      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但这需要知识！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n这世上还有很多很多\n我不知道的事！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǜ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F468FD99700898177E58BC6FF0100100001BE01000A8FD94E164E0A8FD867095F88591A5F88591A000A62114E0D77E5905376844E8BFF0100100002011401DC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以我要向看起来\n很博学的你请教！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我想获得有用的信息，\n借此搭建新的公告牌！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǜ",
