      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 2532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B2C00324E2AFF1A5F026B2151437B497EA70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "第3个：金色的球",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 2552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B2C00334E2AFF1A91D18272768474030000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "原来如此！\n你的眼光就是好。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǜ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 2572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "539F676559826B64FF01000A4F607684773C51495C31662F597D300200100002011401DC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但公告牌不是\n随随便便就能增加的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǜ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 2612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46516C544A724C4E0D662F000A968F968F4FBF4FBF5C3180FD589E52A07684300200100002011401DC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "需要去市政厅申请许可，\n安排施工之类的，很辛苦的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǜ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 2656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9700898153BB5E02653F538575338BF78BB853EFFF0C000A5B89639265BD5DE54E4B7C7B7684FF0C5F888F9B82E67684300200100002011401DC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那怎么办？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 2716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A3600E4E48529EFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你要放弃吗？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 2728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608981653E5F035417FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "解决办法是有的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǜ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 2744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89E351B3529E6CD5662F67097684FF0100100002011401DC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "公告牌就是我！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǜ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 2772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "516C544A724C5C31662F6211FF0100100002011401DC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "或者说，\n我来当公告牌！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǜ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 2796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621680058BF4FF0C000A621167655F53516C544A724CFF0100100002011401DC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "当然，只当到公告牌的\n新增施工开始之前啦。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n总之多亏你帮了大忙！\n我打心底里感谢你！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǜ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 2832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F537136FF0C53EA5F535230516C544A724C7684000A65B0589E65BD5DE55F0059CB4E4B524D5566300200100001BE01000A603B4E4B591A4E8F4F605E2E4E8659275FD9FF01000A621162535FC35E9591CC611F8C224F60FF0100100002011401DC0000",
